<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 28.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 28.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- Libyan leader Muammar Gaddafi expected in Tunis on Monday: &quot;Welcome to President Ben Ali's guest.&quot;</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Gaddafi's visit: a common willingness to boost Tunisian-Libyan relations.</p>
</text>
